The payment service is a deterministic charge test double on port 8005. `POST /charge` accepts a positive amount, refuses amounts of 100000 minor units or more with "Amount exceeds limit", and otherwise refuses a card ending in `0000` with "Card declined". Accepted charges return a UUID reference. Every outcome is stored in `payment_db.charges`, and Swagger is at `/docs`.

Payment tests: **6 passed**. Catalog (6) and cart (9) also passed. Identity and checkout did not collect in this environment because `email-validator` is not installed.

